From: Roki Buildroot <build@roki.local>
Subject: [PATCH] roki: keep IPA proxy base class buildable without workers

The in-process Threaded IPA adapter still derives from IPAProxy, whose unused
fallback path references IPA_PROXY_DIR. Define it as empty when isolated proxy
workers are intentionally omitted.

---
 src/libcamera/meson.build | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/meson.build b/src/libcamera/meson.build
--- a/src/libcamera/meson.build
+++ b/src/libcamera/meson.build
@@ -49,6 +49,10 @@ includes = [
 
 libcamera_deps = []
 
+# Roki uses only the in-process Threaded IPA adapter. Keep the IPAProxy base
+# class buildable without installing isolated proxy worker executables.
+config_h.set('IPA_PROXY_DIR', '')
+
 libatomic = cc.find_library('atomic', required : false)
 libthreads = dependency('threads')
 
-- 
2.51.0
